
==> 员工端 邻修管理（staff）

==> 1/3 编译共享包
==> tsc shared-types
    ok -> packages/shared-types/miniprogram_dist
    sync -> apps/miniapp-owner/miniprogram/miniprogram_npm/@pms/shared-types
    sync -> apps/miniapp-staff/miniprogram/miniprogram_npm/@pms/shared-types
==> tsc api-client
    ok -> packages/api-client/miniprogram_dist
    sync -> apps/miniapp-owner/miniprogram/miniprogram_npm/@pms/api-client
    sync -> apps/miniapp-staff/miniprogram/miniprogram_npm/@pms/api-client
==> tsc miniapp-ui
    ok -> packages/miniapp-ui/miniprogram_dist
    sync -> apps/miniapp-owner/miniprogram/miniprogram_npm/@pms/miniapp-ui
    sync -> apps/miniapp-staff/miniprogram/miniprogram_npm/@pms/miniapp-ui

完成，两个小程序的 miniprogram_npm 已同步，直接编译预览即可。

